   what follows, by pack state (INFERRED from the rows above, the drawn topology and the image):
     pack absent, or both FETs open (below -9 C, SHUTDOWN, a permanent fail): no current through R17, so the voltage loop holds
       SRN, and VSYS with it, at ChargeVoltage (at most 16.884 V written, s120); the kit is carried up to the input limit (11, 9.3.17) (INFERRED)
